    {
      "id": 29,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "FOUR-ARM SET / 四臂集合",
      "pos": [
        0,
        2800
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        340
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 28,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 三个文件合起来才是四臂公平基线\n\nTurbo4 原始与同栈 Refine4 已有历史质量对；本批三个独立低负载文件分别复现同栈、补 base Refine4、补普通8 NFE。不要在一个队列并发运行。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "THIS ROUTE / 本文件用途",
      "pos": [
        840,
        2800
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        340
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 29,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 路线说明\n\n本文件是四臂中的 Turbo4 + 无 Turbo 基座 Refine4。首遍是 Turbo4；精修端必须是同一基座对象且权重补丁为零。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "NFE BOUNDARY / 训练分布边界",
      "pos": [
        1680,
        2800
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        340
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 30,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 总 NFE 相同不等于训练分布相同\n\n普通8 NFE是计算成本控制；Turbo4+Refine4是两个 partial/full 轨迹的组合。报告必须写真实NFE与模型/LoRA栈，不能把两者称为算法等价。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "PARAMETERS / 参数",
      "pos": [
        2520,
        2800
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        340
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 31,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 固定可审计参数\n\n分辨率1056×608、124帧、24fps、相同提示词与seed；Refine固定4 NFE，只允许 audio_denoise 0.35或0.50。1.0属于完全音频重生成，不在这里。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "HUMAN GATE / 人工质量门",
      "pos": [
        3360,
        2800
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        340
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 32,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 默认保留原始结果\n\n精修文件的 accept_candidate 默认 false。先听台词、音色、演绎、远近感、音乐/音效和口型；确认后才能打开。接受时只使用候选音频latent，视频严格回填首遍原始latent。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "RESOURCES / 资源与运行",
      "pos": [
        4200,
        2800
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        340
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 33,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 串行低负载\n\n每次只运行一个工作流；未知补丁栈或资源遥测不足会旁路。无缓存Refine每步仍是完整联合AV Transformer前向，不承诺所有16GB显卡安全。"
      ]
    }
